# ClawdyClaw — environment template
#
# KEY NAMES ONLY. No values. This file is committed (only `.env` is
# gitignored), so never paste a real value here.
#
# Local secrets go in `.env` / `.dev.vars` (both gitignored).
# Production secrets go in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   Workers & Pages > clawdyclaw > Settings > Variables and Secrets
#
# NOTE: wrangler.jsonc currently declares NO X402_* vars. The whole x402 rail
# is configured dashboard-side and is therefore unversioned — see MEMORY.md §1.

# ── Bindings (dashboard: Bindings tab — not secret strings) ──────────────────
# From wrangler.jsonc: DB (D1), SESSIONS (KV), AI, BROWSER, STORAGE (R2),
#                       TASK_QUEUE (producer), X402_IDEMPOTENCY (KV, if bound)

# ── Declared in wrangler.jsonc `vars` (non-secret, committed) ────────────────
# AI_GATEWAY_URL=
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# See MEMORY.md §5 before touching these two — they point at Tempo, not Base.
# PAYMENT_CURRENCY=
# PROTECTED_PATTERNS=

# ── Auth (dashboard: Secret) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH_SECRET=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# VAULT_CIPHER_KEY=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=

# ── x402 rail ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PUBLIC. Serialized into the PAYMENT-REQUIRED header of every 402 response and
# handed to every buyer. Dashboard: Variable, NOT Secret.
# The seller never needs a private key — verify/settle run through the
# facilitator, which holds no key.
# X402_PAY_TO_ADDRESS=

# Optional. Defaults to X402_DEFAULT_FACILITATOR (src/lib/x402.ts:93).
# X402_FACILITATOR_URL=

# "base-sepolia" (default) or "base".
# X402_NETWORK=

# Exactly "true" is required for X402_NETWORK=base; anything else fails closed
# to testnet (src/lib/x402.ts:208).
# X402_MAINNET=

# Exactly "true" disables the payment gate. Local testing only.
# X402_DEV_BYPASS=
# X402_FACILITATOR_TIMEOUT_MS=

# Cloudflare Monetization Gateway PAYMENT-CONTEXT JWT overrides. Both default to
# the pinned values in src/lib/x402.ts; override only for testing.
# X402_PAYMENT_CONTEXT_JWKS_URL=
# X402_PAYMENT_CONTEXT_ISSUER=
# X402_PAYMENT_CONTEXT_AUDIENCE=

# ── Professionals workflow payment ──────────────────────────────────────────
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Signs digital receipts; falls back to AUTH_SECRET when unset.
# RECEIPT_SIGNING_SECRET=

# Base RPC for reading crypto payment receipts.
# BASE_RPC_URL=
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Origin Stripe redirects back to after checkout.
# PUBLIC_ORIGIN=

# ── Buyer side — LOCAL ONLY, never in Cloudflare ─────────────────────────────
# Nothing in src/ calls withX402Client(); the seller Worker never signs.
# For local testnet scripts only.
# X402_BUYER_PRIVATE_KEY is a 66-char 0x-prefixed 64-hex PRIVATE KEY. An
# address (42 chars) is NOT a valid value here.
# X402_BUYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# X402_BUYER_RPC_URL=